# PLP Python Week 3

## Files

- `grade_reporter.py` - Calculates grades, pass/fail counts, and the average score.
- `bug_hunt.py` - Fixes three bugs in a Python program that calculates the sum of 1 to 5.

The hardest bug to find was the loop condition because the program could run without showing an error message. I knew something was wrong because the program produced an answer other than the required 15, so I checked the loop condition and changed it to include 5.
